# Native BLE library binaries. The Windows x64 and macOS arm64 builds are committed, built by the
# native-ble workflow from shimmerble/, so that every build of the driver carries them, Consensys's
# release build included (DEV-1504). Other platforms that ./gradlew buildNative puts here are not.
ShimmerDriverPC/src/main/resources/native/*/
!ShimmerDriverPC/src/main/resources/native/windows-x64/
!ShimmerDriverPC/src/main/resources/native/macos-arm64/
